\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af7\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\f7\fs21\cf0\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch
Naqeebs Accounting System is a double-entry bookkeeping application designed for recording journal vouchers, maintaining account balances, reviewing ledgers and trial balance, producing basic Income Statement and Balance Sheet reports, and handling petty cash.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af7\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\hyphpar0\f7\fs21\cf0\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af11\langfe1033{\loch
This manual combines operating instructions visible in the supplied screens with standard double-entry accounting guidance. Where a screen has not been supplied, the manual explains the accounting purpose of the module without inventing unverified controls.}
\par \pard\plain \s1\rtlch\af12\afs28\ab \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\keep\sb480\sa0\keepn\cf23\f5\fs36\b\dbch\af9{\loch
